WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.200
Good service has five steps.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.700
Identify - spot who needs help before they ask.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.300
Greet - a warm welcome.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.800
Enquire - ask how you can help.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.600
Assist - show them, guide them, or find someone who can.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.000
And resolve - check they're happy before you let them go.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.200
Sometimes the answer is no - a fan can't go that way, or can't bring an item in.

8
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.600
Say it kindly, explain why, and give them something they can do instead.
